# Third-party components

DevOS is built on Debian 13 and includes open-source software from many upstream projects.

Those components remain under their own licenses. Their copyright notices and license texts are
preserved:

- inside the installed image: `/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright`
- in the source packages published by each upstream project

DevOS-specific code, build scripts and artwork in this repository are licensed under GPL-3.0
(see `LICENSE`).

No third-party branding is shown in the DevOS user interface. Product names, logos and trademarks
that appear inside preserved copyright/license files are the property of their respective owners
and are retained solely to satisfy those licenses.
